o \u2014 press the pink button on the Park Map board in the playground and ride up to look over the park.\n\nPlayable in this demo:\n\ud83c\udfa1 Ferris Wheel (new) \u00b7 \ud83d\udedd Slide (base size) \u00b7 \u2696\ufe0f Seesaw (a teddy bear rides along) \u00b7 \ud83c\udf3f Swing \u00b7 \ud83c\udfa8 Drawing friends (all of it)\n\nUnlocked in the full game:\n\u26a1 Lightning Train \u00b7 \ud83d\ude97 Bumper Cars \u00b7 \ud83c\udfaa Wave Swinger \u00b7 \ud83e\ude82 Zipline \u00b7 \ud83c\udf88 Hot Air Balloon \u00b7 \ud83d\uddfc Drop Tower \u00b7\n\ud83c\udfa0 Carousel rides \u00b7 \ud83e\uddd7 Climbing wall \u00b7 \ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Spiral jump tower \u00b7\n\ud83d\udccf Growing every ride with levers (100 m Ferris wheel, 160 m slide, 48 m swing\u2026)\n\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 Fun for the whole family\nA dad built this game for the whole family to enjoy.\n- No ads, no purchases, no data collection (fully offline)\n- Comfort options and a parent settings panel\n- 13 languages supported", "short_description": "Try Wobblewood Park for free \u2014 ride the new Ferris wheel, plus swing, seesaw, slide and drawing friends, fun for the whole family"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wobblewood-privacy.ryu03066.workers.dev/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FamilyGamesHDE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://wobblewood-privacy.ryu03066.workers.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko", "ja", "zh_C